{
  "_comment": [
    "Location classification / filter cases for the offline suite.",
    "Requirements 9.11, 9.12, 9.13, 9.14, 9.17, 9.18. Coordinates resolve",
    "through locations_small.json (the same rows as conftest's",
    "small_location_maps). Each case lists the raw inputs a fetcher would",
    "provide and the expected Location_Filter / Filter_Chain outcome.",
    "",
    "Fields per case:",
    "  location          raw location string",
    "  native_workplace  platform-native workplace field or null",
    "  native_country    platform-native country field or null",
    "  expected_keep     true if the Location_Filter keeps the job",
    "  expected_bucket   primary_eligible | maybe | excluded",
    "  expected_reason   maybe_reason (location_new_england | remote_unspecified",
    "                    | location_unknown) when bucket == maybe, else null",
    "  expected_exclusion non_us | outside_radius when bucket == excluded, else null",
    "  remote_scope      expected Remote_Scope (us | unspecified | null)",
    "  note              which requirement the case covers"
  ],

